Linear links a bare domain in a written description and rewrites list markers, and the first three read-backs still show the old description. The fourth read-back verifies, and the result reports that the description matched only after normalization.
-- seed.json --
{"Issue": [{"id": "1a000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000123", "identifier": "ENG-123", "title": "Verified", "description": "Before"}]}
-- file desired.md --
部署在 notes.jihuanshe.com 上。

- 第一项
- [第二项](https://example.com/b)
-- faults.json --
[{"on": "query:issue", "after": "mutation", "action": "stale", "times": 3}]
-- run --
linear issue update ENG-123 --unprotected --description-file desired.md --json
